# Large source media for the silhouette pipeline — keep the script, not the
# raw competition photos (the generated assets/car-silhouette.webp is committed).
# Note these patterns are deliberately non-recursive: dev-assets/sponsor_logos/
# is small enough to track, so prep_sponsor_logos.py can always be re-run.
dev-assets/*.jpg
dev-assets/*.jpeg
dev-assets/*.JPG
dev-assets/*.JPEG
dev-assets/*.png
dev-assets/*.PNG

# Misc
.env
